        <mxCell id="legend" value="LEGEND&#10;Blue dashed = ordinary peering; purple dotted = UDR / policy steering.&#10;Orange = encrypted transport; teal = post-inspection delivery.&#10;Grey dashed, no arrows = NIC ownership, NOT packet flow.&#10;NIC labels name their VM; router = 3 NICs, firewall = 2 NICs." parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#243746;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#aab8c2;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=10;">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1320" width="940" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reading" value="READ THIS AS A -&gt; B; B -&gt; A AND RESPONSES USE THE SAME PIPELINE.&#10;4 VNets | 5 Ubuntu VMs | 9 NICs | 2 tunnels | original inner addresses.&#10;No Azure VPN gateways, cross-side peering or firewall VPN termination.&#10;ARM test management; manual SSH via routers, operator IPv4 /32 only." parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#243746;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#aab8c2;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=10;">
          <mxGeometry x="990" y="1320" width="980" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="customer-lifecycle" value="CUSTOMER LIFECYCLE TEST | 192.168.77.0/24 + workload VM: CREATED, TESTED, THEN REMOVED.&#10;Customer-only: peering + UDRs + delivery-table update; deleted prefix explicitly unreachable.&#10;24 original-source deliveries + 6 selective denials; removal/no-loop checks passed.&#10;CAVEAT: combined runs after DNS/shutdown interruption; audited redundant DHCP rule difference after reboot.&#10;Not an uninterrupted lifecycle or production multi-customer qualification; service/tunnel overlaps excluded." parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#243746;fillColor=#fff9cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=10;">
